# Data / generated outputs
/data
output/

# Scratch / one-off run output at repo root (e.g. phase_audit_results.txt) -- this
# class of file is scratch by convention, not a committed data product.
/*_results.txt

# Session scratchpad (diagnostic scripts, one-off CSVs/PNGs) -- explicitly scratch
# per this project's own tooling conventions, not meant to be tracked.
.tmp/

# Ad-hoc / one-off diagnostic and debugging scripts (preserved on disk, not tracked).
#
# HARD RULE: any script whose output is cited as a committed result anywhere (a
# "Committed Case N Result" table in CLAUDE.md, a number in a paper/abstract, a
# regression test's expected value) MUST NOT live here -- track it under scripts/
# proper instead, even if it was written as a one-off. This rule exists because
# scripts/run_baseline_fit.py did exactly that: it produced the committed Case 1
# numbers (w=0.46993, g=-0.33688, theta_bar=8.2662, job 25799987, Jun 2026), was
# never tracked (almost certainly swept into this directory during the Aug 2026
# scripts/ reorg, then later deleted from disk during ad-hoc cleanup), and by the
# time anyone went looking for it (Sep 2026) there was no git history to recover it
# from -- the call site importing it (scripts/utils/run_prelim_physfilter.py) still
# references it, but the file itself is gone for good. See scripts/fit_case1.py for
# the reconstruction and docs/weighting_usage.md for the open questions it left.
scripts/adhoc/

# Local SPICE / metakernels
*.tm
!*.template.tm
*.bsp
*.bc

# IDE / Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# logs and generated outputs (not tracked)
*.log
outputs/
results/
results_tif/
recovered_code.txt

# local notes (kept on disk, not in the repo)
ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS.md
SPICE_FIX_SUMMARY.md
phase_audit_results.txt
/CLAUDE.md
